## Ingredients

- 1 cup (90g) rolled oats
- 1 cup (240g) milk (or oat milk)
- 1/2 cup (120g) plain yogurt
- 2 tbsp (40g) maple syrup
- 1/2 tsp (1g) ground cinnamon
- Pinch of salt
- 1/4 cup (30g) toasted walnuts, chopped
- Fresh berries, to serve

## Instructions

1. In a jar or container, combine the oats, milk, yogurt, maple syrup, cinnamon, and salt. Stir well.
2. Cover and refrigerate overnight, or at least 4 hours.
3. In the morning, stir the oats and thin with a splash of milk if needed.
4. Top with toasted walnuts and fresh berries before serving.
